Subject: [PATCH 547/913] prod/optee/stm32mp2: create stm32 power domain module
 driver

Create a new module driver named mod_stm32_pd, which can handle power
domain actions on stm32mp2 product.

Add set/get for SCMI_GPU power domain.
It will enable/disable required regulator and clock.

